          "special_name": "Undead"
        },
        "2": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "details": "<p>When an ally enter&nbsp;<strong><img src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Skill%20Icon/FFXIVIcons%20Battle(PvE)/08_DRG/blood_for_blood.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\">@UUID[JournalEntry.GJevbCPM8cffm1QM]{Crisis}&nbsp;</strong>for the first time this scene, it gains <img src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Buff%20Icon/Shield.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\"><strong>@UUID[JournalEntry.wrw2ENSwzCBjztvt]{10 Dark Shield}</strong></p>",
          "icon": "",
          "roll": "",
          "special_name": "Spirit Protection"
        },
        "3": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "details": "<p>When the Wisp take damage and is not reduce to <strong>0</strong> HP, it immediately cast <strong>【Ghostly Fire】</strong></p>",
